"""Idea Foundry: a local idea-to-app workbench."""

__version__ = "0.28.0"

__release_notes__ = "Builder-sized delivery: Plan for my builder creates a validated outline and small task batches, sized to configured routes. Guided review catches missing file/interface dependencies, protected foundation tests and undiscoverable nested tests before approval. Scoped Ollama JSON restricts writable file keys; syntax/scope rejection gets one same-model focused correction without forcing a whole-app rewrite. Account-wide HTTP 401/402 skips futile same-account alternates within the run; exhaustion retains reasons. Models now shows published/installed/configured limits with unknowns explicit; local metadata reads never generate text. New automatic local builder profiles use 16K context/4K output; saved routes are kept. Dashboard observes source rejection separately. Approval, scope, frozen checks, consent and shared invocation limits remain enforced. Fixture/browser reliability verified; live provider/model quality and Windows/GPU speed remain unmeasured."
